#
# sample
#
# Version: Look at the first constant definitions below!
#
# Project Description:
#   en: Extracts a sample of data records.
#   de: Erstellt eine Auswahl von Datensaetzen aus der Eingabedatei.
#
# Dependencies:
# - …
#
# Usage:
#   sample 100 dixtverbs.txt  # Would write 100 lines from "dictverbs.txt" to "sample.txt".
#   sample --random 50 dixtverbs.txt  # Would write 50 random lines from "dictverbs.txt" to "sample.txt".
